    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Grapplers and Space Stuff is a 2-player co-op game with a focus on teamwork and fun. Each player receives a brand new spaceship to control.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/e73e5f8f1504b9ae2b8d75433c0ac21a.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/e73e5f8f1504b9ae2b8d75433c0ac21a.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/e73e5f8f1504b9ae2b8d75433c0ac21a.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's the hook?</h2>Well, the grapple hook. All our spaceships are bundled with it without any extra fee. And who doesn't like grapple hooks? You can grab stuff with them. Or you can grab each other and be that stuff. All you could dream of.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/615aba6561a77c5174956ceb92a9ea92.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/615aba6561a77c5174956ceb92a9ea92.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/615aba6561a77c5174956ceb92a9ea92.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab you friend</h2>Already been mentioned, but let's focus on that one more time. It's a two-player online co-op game. You can play online. In coop. With a friend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/c76782452f4342e8be4f151cad9b0358.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/c76782452f4342e8be4f151cad9b0358.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/c76782452f4342e8be4f151cad9b0358.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More stuff</h2>We are planning a bunch of different locations with unique gameplay mechanics. But as the game is in development anything can happen. For now, you would have to believe us, but we promise to show you more soon. <br><br><strong>Wishlist Grapplers and Space Stuff</strong> and follow our updates for more info!",
    "about_the_game": "Grapplers and Space Stuff is a 2-player co-op game with a focus on teamwork and fun. Each player receives a brand new spaceship to control.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=480 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/e73e5f8f1504b9ae2b8d75433c0ac21a.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/e73e5f8f1504b9ae2b8d75433c0ac21a.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/e73e5f8f1504b9ae2b8d75433c0ac21a.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's the hook?</h2>Well, the grapple hook. All our spaceships are bundled with it without any extra fee. And who doesn't like grapple hooks? You can grab stuff with them. Or you can grab each other and be that stuff. All you could dream of.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/615aba6561a77c5174956ceb92a9ea92.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/615aba6561a77c5174956ceb92a9ea92.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/615aba6561a77c5174956ceb92a9ea92.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grab you friend</h2>Already been mentioned, but let's focus on that one more time. It's a two-player online co-op game. You can play online. In coop. With a friend.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/c76782452f4342e8be4f151cad9b0358.poster.avif?t=1707902725\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/c76782452f4342e8be4f151cad9b0358.webm?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726030/extras/c76782452f4342e8be4f151cad9b0358.mp4?t=1707902725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More stuff</h2>We are planning a bunch of different locations with unique gameplay mechanics. But as the game is in development anything can happen. For now, you would have to believe us, but we promise to show you more soon. <br><br><strong>Wishlist Grapplers and Space Stuff</strong> and follow our updates for more info!",
